LATENT DISPATCH
Thu Sep 24 · 4 items · ~3 min

TANAGER-CODER 70B IS OUT
Ahead of the "early October" guidance. Open weights, permissive license, and the multi-file editing quality we saw in preview holds up. It is on Kestrel today at $1.20 / $3.60 per million and Argent says tomorrow. If you run an overnight coding agent, this is your new baseline. https://latentdispatch.ai/p/tanager-70b

ARGENT ADDS A SECOND EU REGION
Amsterdam joins Frankfurt. Same models, same prices, and a data-residency attestation on the trust page. Relevant to anyone with European customers who ask where the tokens go.

WHAT OCTOBER LOOKS LIKE
Our forward look: Pelagic 3, at least one more mid-tier price round, Ostrava's document model on Argent, and (we hear) a new frontier release from one of the two labs that has been quiet all quarter. We will have the details when they are public. https://latentdispatch.ai/p/october-preview

SHORT TAKES
· Larkspur 1.3: per-state spend caps.
· Halcyon adds bounding boxes to the 3.1 Mini.
· Marrow Speech opens a self-hosted option.

